#. Translators: name of the add-on, used as the submenu label and the input gestures category.
#. Translators: title of the add-on panel in NVDA's settings.
#. Translators: category of the add-on commands in the Input gestures dialog.
#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "MiCrucigramaAccesible"
msgstr "MiCrucigramaAccesible"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that starts a new crossword.
#. Translators: item of the menu of the crossword board.
msgid "&New crossword..."
msgstr "&Nuevo crucigrama..."

#. Translators: help text of the "New crossword" menu item.
msgid "Choose a crossword and start it"
msgstr "Elegir un crucigrama y empezarlo"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that opens the crossword of the day.
msgid "Crossword of the &day"
msgstr "Crucigrama del &día"

#. Translators: help text of the "Crossword of the day" menu item.
msgid "A new crossword every day, the same for everyone"
msgstr "Un crucigrama nuevo cada día, el mismo para todo el mundo"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that opens the crossword course.
msgid "&Learn to play..."
msgstr "&Aprender a jugar..."

#. Translators: help text of the "Learn to play" menu item.
msgid "Guided lessons to learn how to solve crosswords"
msgstr "Lecciones guiadas para aprender a resolver crucigramas"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that shows the statistics.
msgid "My &statistics..."
msgstr "Mis &estadísticas..."

#. Translators: help text of the "My statistics" menu item.
msgid "Crosswords solved, best times and days in a row"
msgstr "Crucigramas resueltos, mejores tiempos y días seguidos"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that shows all the keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "&Keyboard shortcuts..."
msgstr "&Atajos de teclado..."

#. Translators: help text of the "Keyboard shortcuts" menu item.
msgid "The keys of the board"
msgstr "Las teclas del tablero"

#. Translators: item of the add-on submenu that opens the crossword in progress.
msgid "&Continue the crossword"
msgstr "&Continuar el crucigrama"

#. Translators: help text of the "Continue the crossword" menu item.
msgid "Open the crossword you left unfinished"
msgstr "Abrir el crucigrama que dejaste sin terminar"

#. Translators: label of the add-on submenu inside NVDA's Tools menu.
msgid "Mi&CrucigramaAccesible"
msgstr "Mi&CrucigramaAccesible"

#. Translators: help text of the add-on submenu.
msgid "Accessible crosswords"
msgstr "Crucigramas accesibles"

#. Translators: reported when asking for a crossword while another one is being prepared.
msgid "A crossword is already being prepared."
msgstr "Ya se está preparando un crucigrama."

#. Translators: asked when starting a new crossword while another one is unfinished.
msgid "You have an unfinished crossword. If you start a new one, it will be lost. Start a new crossword?"
msgstr "Tienes un crucigrama sin terminar. Si empiezas otro, se perderá. ¿Empezar un crucigrama nuevo?"

#. Translators: title of the confirmation to start a new crossword.
#. Translators: title of the dialog to start a new crossword.
msgid "New crossword"
msgstr "Nuevo crucigrama"

#. Translators: said while a new crossword is generated.
msgid "Preparing the crossword..."
msgstr "Preparando el crucigrama..."

#. Translators: reported when a crossword could not be generated.
msgid "The crossword could not be prepared. Please try again."
msgstr "No se pudo preparar el crucigrama. Inténtalo de nuevo."

#. Translators: reported when the saved crossword cannot be opened.
msgid "The unfinished crossword could not be opened. You can start a new one."
msgstr "No se pudo abrir el crucigrama sin terminar. Puedes empezar uno nuevo."

#. Translators: title of the message about the saved crossword.
msgid "Continue the crossword"
msgstr "Continuar el crucigrama"

#. Translators: said after solving a crossword faster than ever in that size and difficulty.
msgid "It is your best time in this kind of crossword!"
msgstr "¡Es tu mejor tiempo en este tipo de crucigrama!"

#. Translators: description of the command that opens the crossword course, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Opens the crossword course Learn to play"
msgstr "Abre el curso de crucigramas Aprender a jugar"

#. Translators: said when opening the crossword of the day after solving it, as in "You already solved today's crossword. You have solved it 3 days in a row. Come back tomorrow for a new one."
msgid "You already solved today's crossword. {streak} Come back tomorrow for a new one."
msgstr "Ya resolviste el crucigrama de hoy. {streak} Vuelve mañana para uno nuevo."

#. Translators: title of the message about the crossword of the day.
#. Translators: heading of the statistics.
#. Translators: added before the description in the title of the crossword of the day.
msgid "Crossword of the day"
msgstr "Crucigrama del día"

#. Translators: asked before starting the crossword of the day.
msgid "How do you want to play today's crossword?"
msgstr "¿Cómo quieres jugar el crucigrama de hoy?"

#. Translators: button to play the crossword of the day with help.
msgid "&With help"
msgstr "&Con ayudas"

#. Translators: button to play the crossword of the day without help.
msgid "With&out help"
msgstr "&Sin ayudas"

#. Translators: said while the crossword of the day is generated.
msgid "Preparing the crossword of the day..."
msgstr "Preparando el crucigrama del día..."

#. Translators: description of the command that opens the crossword board, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Opens the crossword board: continues the unfinished crossword or starts a new one"
msgstr "Abre el tablero del crucigrama: continúa el crucigrama sin terminar o empieza uno nuevo"

#. Translators: description of the command that opens the crossword of the day, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Opens the crossword of the day"
msgstr "Abre el crucigrama del día"

#. Translators: description of the command that shows the statistics, shown in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Shows your crossword statistics"
msgstr "Muestra tus estadísticas de crucigramas"

#. Translators: joins the last item of a list, as in "3 across, 4 across and 5 down".
msgid "{items} and {last}"
msgstr "{items} y {last}"

#. Translators: a crossword word by its number, for example "2 across".
msgid "{number} across"
msgstr "{number} horizontal"

#. Translators: a crossword word by its number, for example "5 down".
msgid "{number} down"
msgstr "{number} vertical"

#. Translators: length of a crossword word, as in "2 across, 4 letters: clue".
#. Translators: the length of a crossword word, for example "5 letters".
msgid "{count} letter"
msgid_plural "{count} letters"
msgstr[0] "{count} letra"
msgstr[1] "{count} letras"

#. Translators: a crossword word with its clue, for example "2 across, 4 letters: Says quack".
msgid "{word}, {letters}: {clue}"
msgstr "{word}, {letters}: {clue}"

#. Translators: what a word already has written, said after its clue, as in "Written: duck".
msgid "Written: {letters}"
msgstr "Escrito: {letters}"

#. Translators: an empty cell when reading a word as written, as in "du, gap, k".
msgid "gap"
msgstr "hueco"

#. Translators: said when reading a word that has no letters written.
msgid "nothing written"
msgstr "nada escrito"

#. Translators: a crossword cell without a letter written yet.
msgid "empty"
msgstr "vacía"

#. Translators: a cell of the current word, as in "C, letter 3 of 5" or "empty, letter 3 of 5".
msgid "{content}, letter {position} of {length}"
msgstr "{content}, letra {position} de {length}"

#. Translators: added when the cell is shared with another word, as in "crosses 1 down, letter 2".
msgid "crosses {word}, letter {position}"
msgstr "cruza con {word}, letra {position}"

#. Translators: the other word at a crossing, as in "1 down, letter 2. 1 down, 4 letters: clue".
msgid "Letter {position} of {word}"
msgstr "Letra {position} de {word}"

#. Translators: the position of a cell on the board, as in "Row 3, column 5".
msgid "Row {row}, column {column}"
msgstr "Fila {row}, columna {column}"

#. Translators: how many words are full, as in "5 of 12 words complete".
msgid "{done} of {total} word complete"
msgid_plural "{done} of {total} words complete"
msgstr[0] "{done} de {total} palabra completa"
msgstr[1] "{done} de {total} palabras completas"

#. Translators: the words that still have empty cells, as in "Missing: 2 across, 4 down".
msgid "Missing: {words}"
msgstr "Faltan: {words}"

#. Translators: said when the last empty cell of a word is filled (it does not say if it is right).
msgid "{word} complete"
msgstr "{word} completa"

#. Translators: said when every cell is filled but some letter is wrong, in a crossword without help.
msgid "The crossword is full, but there are wrong letters"
msgstr "El crucigrama está lleno, pero hay letras incorrectas"

#. Translators: said when every cell is filled but some letter is wrong, as in "... wrong letters in 3 across".
msgid "The crossword is full, but there are wrong letters in {words}"
msgstr "El crucigrama está lleno, pero hay letras incorrectas en {words}"

#. Translators: said when deleting in a cell that has no letter.
msgid "nothing to delete"
msgstr "nada que borrar"

#. Translators: said after deleting a letter, as in "C deleted".
msgid "{letter} deleted"
msgstr "{letter} borrada"

#. Translators: result of Check in a crossword without help, as in "2 wrong letters".
msgid "{count} wrong letter"
msgid_plural "{count} wrong letters"
msgstr[0] "{count} letra incorrecta"
msgstr[1] "{count} letras incorrectas"

#. Translators: result of Check, as in "2 wrong letters, in 3 across and 5 down".
msgid "{count} wrong letter, in {words}"
msgid_plural "{count} wrong letters, in {words}"
msgstr[0] "{count} letra incorrecta, en {words}"
msgstr[1] "{count} letras incorrectas, en {words}"

#. Translators: result of Check when every written letter is right.
msgid "All the letters you wrote are right"
msgstr "Todas las letras que escribiste están bien"

#. Translators: added to the result of Check, as in "7 empty cells left".
msgid "{count} empty cell left"
msgid_plural "{count} empty cells left"
msgstr[0] "Falta {count} casilla"
msgstr[1] "Faltan {count} casillas"

#. Translators: help for a cell whose letter is already right, as in "The R of this cell is already right."
msgid "The {letter} of this cell is already right."
msgstr "La {letter} de esta casilla ya está bien."

#. Translators: help that tells the letter of the cell without writing it, as in "Help: here goes R".
msgid "Help: here goes {letter}"
msgstr "Ayuda: aquí va la {letter}"

#. Translators: help that tells the whole word, as in "Help: 3 across is duck: D, U, C, K".
msgid "Help: {word} is {answer}: {letters}"
msgstr "Ayuda: {word} es {answer}: {letters}"

#. Translators: part of a duration.
msgid "{count} hour"
msgid_plural "{count} hours"
msgstr[0] "{count} hora"
msgstr[1] "{count} horas"

#. Translators: part of a duration.
msgid "{count} minute"
msgid_plural "{count} minutes"
msgstr[0] "{count} minuto"
msgstr[1] "{count} minutos"

#. Translators: part of a duration.
msgid "{count} second"
msgid_plural "{count} seconds"
msgstr[0] "{count} segundo"
msgstr[1] "{count} segundos"

#. Translators: days in a row solving the crossword of the day.
msgid "You have solved it {count} day in a row."
msgid_plural "You have solved it {count} days in a row."
msgstr[0] "Lo has resuelto {count} día seguido."
msgstr[1] "Lo has resuelto {count} días seguidos."

#. Translators: the children's crosswords in the statistics.
msgid "Children's"
msgstr "Infantiles"

#. Translators: a type of crossword in the statistics, as in "Medium, Normal".
msgid "{size}, {difficulty}"
msgstr "{size}, {difficulty}"

#. Translators: a line of the statistics, as in "Medium, Normal: 5 solved, 2 without help. Best time: 20 minutes."
msgid "{type}: {count} solved, {without} without help. Best time: {time}."
msgid_plural "{type}: {count} solved, {without} without help. Best time: {time}."
msgstr[0] "{type}: {count} resuelto, {without} sin ayudas. Mejor tiempo: {time}."
msgstr[1] "{type}: {count} resueltos, {without} sin ayudas. Mejor tiempo: {time}."

#. Translators: a line of the statistics: help used in the solved crosswords.
msgid "Help used: {count} time."
msgid_plural "Help used: {count} times."
msgstr[0] "Ayudas usadas: {count} vez."
msgstr[1] "Ayudas usadas: {count} veces."

#. Translators: statistics when no crossword has been solved yet.
msgid "You have not solved any crossword yet."
msgstr "Todavía no has resuelto ningún crucigrama."

#. Translators: a line of the statistics about the crossword of the day.
msgid "Days in a row: {count}."
msgstr "Días seguidos: {count}."

#. Translators: a line of the statistics about the crossword of the day.
msgid "Record: {count} day in a row."
msgid_plural "Record: {count} days in a row."
msgstr[0] "Récord: {count} día seguido."
msgstr[1] "Récord: {count} días seguidos."

#. Translators: a line of the statistics about the crossword of the day.
msgid "Solved in total: {count}."
msgstr "Resueltos en total: {count}."

#. Translators: a line of the statistics about the crossword of the day.
msgid "Today's crossword is already solved."
msgstr "El crucigrama de hoy ya está resuelto."

#. Translators: heading of the statistics.
msgid "Crosswords solved"
msgstr "Crucigramas resueltos"

#. Translators: a line of the statistics about the course.
msgid "Lessons finished: {done} of {total}."
msgstr "Lecciones terminadas: {done} de {total}."

#. Translators: a line of the statistics about the course.
msgid "Stars: {stars} of {total}."
msgstr "Estrellas: {stars} de {total}."

#. Translators: heading of the statistics.
#. Translators: title of the list of lessons of the course.
msgid "Learn to play"
msgstr "Aprender a jugar"

#. Translators: a crossword size: about 6 words.
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Pequeño"

#. Translators: a crossword size: about 12 words.
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Mediano"

#. Translators: a crossword size: about 20 words.
msgid "Large"
msgstr "Grande"

#. Translators: a crossword difficulty level.
msgid "Easy"
msgstr "Fácil"

#. Translators: a crossword difficulty level.
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

#. Translators: a crossword difficulty level.
msgid "Hard"
msgstr "Difícil"

#. Translators: a theme of the children's crosswords.
msgid "Animals"
msgstr "Animales"

#. Translators: a theme of the children's crosswords.
msgid "Food"
msgstr "Comida"

#. Translators: a theme of the children's crosswords.
msgid "Colours"
msgstr "Colores"

#. Translators: a theme of the children's crosswords.
msgid "The body"
msgstr "El cuerpo"

#. Translators: a theme of the children's crosswords.
msgid "The house"
msgstr "La casa"

#. Translators: a theme of the children's crosswords.
msgid "School"
msgstr "La escuela"

#. Translators: describes a children's crossword, for example "Children's: Animals, 6 words".
msgid "Children's: {theme}, {count} word"
msgid_plural "Children's: {theme}, {count} words"
msgstr[0] "Infantil: {theme}, {count} palabra"
msgstr[1] "Infantil: {theme}, {count} palabras"

#. Translators: describes a crossword, for example "Medium, Normal, 12 words".
msgid "{size}, {difficulty}, {count} word"
msgid_plural "{size}, {difficulty}, {count} words"
msgstr[0] "{size}, {difficulty}, {count} palabra"
msgstr[1] "{size}, {difficulty}, {count} palabras"

#. Translators: heading of the across clues (the words that are read from left to right).
msgid "Across"
msgstr "Horizontales"

#. Translators: heading of the down clues (the words that are read from top to bottom).
msgid "Down"
msgstr "Verticales"

#. Translators: a clue in the preview, for example "3. Colour of the sky (4 letters; row 2, column 5)".
msgid "{number}. {clue} ({letters}; row {row}, column {column})"
msgstr "{number}. {clue} ({letters}; fila {row}, columna {column})"

#. Translators: size of the board in the crossword preview.
msgid "{rows} rows and {columns} columns."
msgstr "{rows} filas y {columns} columnas."

#. Translators: explains the board of the preview, where each letter is a cell.
msgid "Each letter is a cell; a dot is a cell without a letter."
msgstr "Cada letra es una casilla; el punto es una casilla sin letra."

#. Translators: a row of the board in the preview, for example "Row 1: . . C A S A".
msgid "Row {row}: {cells}"
msgstr "Fila {row}: {cells}"

#. Translators: heading of the board in the crossword preview.
msgid "Board"
msgstr "Tablero"

#. Translators: heading of the solutions at the end of the crossword preview.
msgid "Solutions"
msgstr "Soluciones"

#. Translators: praise when an exercise of the course is done.
msgid "Very good!"
msgstr "¡Muy bien!"

#. Translators: praise when an exercise of the course is done.
msgid "Excellent!"
msgstr "¡Excelente!"

#. Translators: praise when an exercise of the course is done.
msgid "You did it!"
msgstr "¡Lo lograste!"

#. Translators: praise when an exercise of the course is done.
msgid "Well done!"
msgstr "¡Bien hecho!"

#. Translators: stars earned in an exercise of the course.
msgid "You earned {count} star."
msgid_plural "You earned {count} stars."
msgstr[0] "Ganaste {count} estrella."
msgstr[1] "Ganaste {count} estrellas."

#. Translators: said when trying to change the board of an exercise that is already done.
msgid "This exercise is already done."
msgstr "Este ejercicio ya está hecho."

#. Translators: said when typing something that is not a letter on the board.
msgid "Only letters can be written."
msgstr "Solo se pueden escribir letras."

#. Translators: said in a lesson when a letter does not go in the cell, followed by the clue, as in "The B does not go here. Clue: Says quack."
msgid "The {letter} does not go here. Clue: {clue}"
msgstr "La {letter} no va aquí. Pista: {clue}"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Moving around the board"
msgstr "Moverse por el tablero"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Follow the words cell by cell; a bump sound means there is no letter that way"
msgstr "Seguir las palabras casilla a casilla; el sonido de choque indica que por ahí no hay letra"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "First or last letter of the word"
msgstr "Primera o última letra de la palabra"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Next or previous word"
msgstr "Palabra siguiente o anterior"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "List of all the clues, to go to a word"
msgstr "Lista de todas las pistas, para ir a una palabra"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Writing"
msgstr "Escribir"

#. Translators: the keys that write on the board, in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Letters"
msgstr "Letras"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Write the letter and move on along the word; accents do not count, Ñ does"
msgstr "Escribir la letra y avanzar por la palabra; las tildes no cuentan, la Ñ sí"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Delete the letter of the cell or, if it is empty, the one before"
msgstr "Borrar la letra de la casilla o, si está vacía, la anterior"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Delete the letter of the cell"
msgstr "Borrar la letra de la casilla"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Undo the last change"
msgstr "Deshacer el último cambio"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Listening"
msgstr "Escuchar"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Repeat the clue of the word"
msgstr "Repetir la pista de la palabra"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "At a crossing, the clue of the other word"
msgstr "En un cruce, la pista de la otra palabra"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Letters of the word, with the empty cells"
msgstr "Letras de la palabra, con las casillas vacías"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "The word as it is written, with the gaps"
msgstr "La palabra tal como está escrita, con los huecos"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Read the current cell again"
msgstr "Volver a leer la casilla actual"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "How many words are complete and which are missing"
msgstr "Cuántas palabras están completas y cuáles faltan"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Row and column of the cell"
msgstr "Fila y columna de la casilla"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Ayuda"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "The letter that goes in the cell; you write it"
msgstr "La letra que va en la casilla; la escribes tú"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "The whole word, spelled; you write it"
msgstr "La palabra entera, deletreada; la escribes tú"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Menu and window"
msgstr "Menú y ventana"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Board menu: check, restart, new crossword, keyboard shortcuts and close"
msgstr "Menú del tablero: comprobar, reiniciar, nuevo crucigrama, atajos de teclado y cerrar"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "This list of keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Esta lista de atajos de teclado"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Close the board; the crossword is kept"
msgstr "Cerrar el tablero; el crucigrama se guarda"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Close the board"
msgstr "Cerrar el tablero"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Lessons"
msgstr "Lecciones"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Repeat the instruction of the exercise"
msgstr "Repetir lo que hay que hacer en el ejercicio"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Repeat the explanation of the lesson"
msgstr "Repetir la explicación de la lección"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts, in lessons.
msgid "In the lessons a letter that does not fit is not written, and Control+Z does nothing"
msgstr "En las lecciones una letra que no va no se escribe, y Control+Z no hace nada"

#. Translators: heading in the list of keyboard shortcuts: commands that work from anywhere.
msgid "From anywhere"
msgstr "Desde cualquier lugar"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Open the board: continue the unfinished crossword or start a new one"
msgstr "Abrir el tablero: continuar el crucigrama sin terminar o empezar uno nuevo"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Open the crossword of the day"
msgstr "Abrir el crucigrama del día"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Open Learn to play"
msgstr "Abrir Aprender a jugar"

#. Translators: description in the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Show My statistics"
msgstr "Mostrar Mis estadísticas"

#. Translators: shown in the list of keyboard shortcuts when a command has no key.
msgid "no key assigned"
msgstr "sin tecla asignada"

#. Translators: introduction of the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "You can change these keys in the NVDA menu, Preferences, Input gestures, category MiCrucigramaAccesible (with the focus on the board for the board keys)."
msgstr "Puedes cambiar estas teclas en el menú de NVDA, Preferencias, Gestos de entrada, categoría MiCrucigramaAccesible (con el foco en el tablero para las teclas del tablero)."

#. Translators: title of the window with the list of keyboard shortcuts.
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Atajos de teclado"

#. Translators: state of a completed lesson in the list of lessons.
msgid "Completed, {stars} of {total} stars."
msgstr "Completada, {stars} de {total} estrellas."

#. Translators: state of a lesson started but not finished, in the list of lessons.
msgid "In progress: {done} of {total} exercises."
msgstr "Empezada: {done} de {total} ejercicios."

#. Translators: state of a lesson not started, in the list of lessons.
msgid "Pending."
msgstr "Pendiente."

#. Translators: block heading before the first lesson of a block, as in "Block A, Getting to know the crossword."
msgid "Block {block}, {title}."
msgstr "Bloque {block}, {title}."

#. Translators: label of the list of lessons.
msgid "&Lessons:"
msgstr "&Lecciones:"

#. Translators: button that starts the selected lesson.
#. Translators: button that starts the exercises of a lesson.
msgid "&Start"
msgstr "&Empezar"

#. Translators: button that closes the list of lessons.
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "&Cerrar"

#. Translators: said at the end of a lesson explanation.
msgid "This lesson has {count} exercise."
msgid_plural "This lesson has {count} exercises."
msgstr[0] "Esta lección tiene {count} ejercicio."
msgstr[1] "Esta lección tiene {count} ejercicios."

#. Translators: said when a lesson is resumed, as in "You will continue from exercise 3."
msgid "You will continue from exercise {number}."
msgstr "Seguirás desde el ejercicio {number}."

#. Translators: button that goes back to the list of lessons.
msgid "&Back"
msgstr "&Volver"

#. Translators: said when a lesson is finished, as in "You finished lesson 1! You have 5 of 6 stars."
msgid "You finished lesson {id}! You have {stars} of {total} stars."
msgstr "¡Terminaste la lección {id}! Tienes {stars} de {total} estrellas."

#. Translators: said at the end of a lesson.
msgid "Open the menu with the Applications key to go on to the next lesson."
msgstr "Abre el menú con la tecla Aplicaciones para pasar a la siguiente lección."

#. Translators: label of the choice between a general crossword and the children's themes.
msgid "&Crossword:"
msgstr "&Crucigrama:"

#. Translators: an option of the Crossword choice: a crossword for everyone.
msgid "General"
msgstr "General"

#. Translators: an option of the Crossword choice, for example "Children's: Animals".
msgid "Children's: {theme}"
msgstr "Infantil: {theme}"

#. Translators: label of the crossword size choice.
msgid "&Size:"
msgstr "&Tamaño:"

#. Translators: label of the crossword difficulty choice.
msgid "&Difficulty:"
msgstr "&Dificultad:"

#. Translators: checkbox of the new crossword dialog.
msgid "With &help: F7 tells letters and words, and Check says where the mistakes are"
msgstr "Con &ayudas: F7 dice letras y palabras, y Comprobar dice dónde están los errores"

#. Translators: title of the list of all the clues of the crossword.
msgid "Clues"
msgstr "Pistas"

#. Translators: added in the list of clues to a word with all its cells filled.
msgid "{clue} (complete)"
msgstr "{clue} (completa)"

#. Translators: label of the list of clues.
msgid "&Clues:"
msgstr "&Pistas:"

#. Translators: title of the statistics window.
msgid "My statistics"
msgstr "Mis estadísticas"

#. Translators: check box in the settings panel.
msgid "Play s&ounds (complete words, solved crosswords)"
msgstr "Reproducir s&onidos (palabras completas, crucigramas resueltos)"

#. Translators: check box in the settings panel.
msgid "Say which word &crosses each cell"
msgstr "Decir con qué palabra se &cruza cada casilla"

#. Translators: check box in the settings panel.
msgid "Say what is &written when entering a word"
msgstr "Decir lo &escrito al entrar en una palabra"

#. Translators: button in the settings panel.
msgid "&Delete my progress and statistics..."
msgstr "&Borrar mi progreso y mis estadísticas..."

#. Translators: asked before deleting the statistics.
msgid "This deletes your progress in the course, the crosswords you solved, your best times and the days in a row. Unfinished crosswords are kept. It cannot be undone. Delete them?"
msgstr "Esto borra tu progreso en el curso, los crucigramas que resolviste, tus mejores tiempos y los días seguidos. Los crucigramas a medias se quedan. No se puede deshacer. ¿Borrarlos?"

#. Translators: title of the confirmation to delete the statistics.
msgid "Delete my progress and statistics"
msgstr "Borrar mi progreso y mis estadísticas"

#. Translators: reported after deleting the statistics.
msgid "Your progress and statistics were deleted."
msgstr "Se borraron tu progreso y tus estadísticas."

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves up, if there is a cell with a letter above"
msgstr "Sube, si arriba hay una casilla con letra"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves down, if there is a cell with a letter below"
msgstr "Baja, si abajo hay una casilla con letra"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves left, if there is a cell with a letter on the left"
msgstr "Va a la izquierda, si hay una casilla con letra"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves right, if there is a cell with a letter on the right"
msgstr "Va a la derecha, si hay una casilla con letra"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the first letter of the word"
msgstr "Va a la primera letra de la palabra"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the last letter of the word"
msgstr "Va a la última letra de la palabra"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the next word"
msgstr "Va a la palabra siguiente"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Moves to the previous word"
msgstr "Va a la palabra anterior"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Shows the list of all the clues, to go to a word"
msgstr "Muestra la lista de todas las pistas, para ir a una palabra"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Deletes the letter of the cell or, if it is empty, the one before"
msgstr "Borra la letra de la casilla o, si está vacía, la anterior"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Deletes the letter of the cell"
msgstr "Borra la letra de la casilla"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Undoes the last change"
msgstr "Deshace el último cambio"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Repeats the clue of the word"
msgstr "Repite la pista de la palabra"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "At a crossing, reports the clue of the other word"
msgstr "En un cruce, dice la pista de la otra palabra"

#. Translators: said when asking for the crossing word in a cell that is not a crossing.
msgid "No other word crosses here."
msgstr "Aquí no se cruza otra palabra."

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Reports the letters of the word, with the empty cells"
msgstr "Dice las letras de la palabra, con las casillas vacías"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Reads the word as it is written, with the gaps"
msgstr "Lee la palabra tal como está escrita, con los huecos"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Reads the current cell again"
msgstr "Vuelve a leer la casilla actual"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Help: tells the letter that goes in the cell, without writing it"
msgstr "Ayuda: dice la letra que va en la casilla, sin escribirla"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Help: tells the whole word, without writing it"
msgstr "Ayuda: dice la palabra entera, sin escribirla"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Reports how many words are complete and which are missing"
msgstr "Dice cuántas palabras están completas y cuáles faltan"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Reports the row and the column of the cell"
msgstr "Dice la fila y la columna de la casilla"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Opens the menu of the board"
msgstr "Abre el menú del tablero"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Shows the keyboard shortcuts of the board"
msgstr "Muestra los atajos de teclado del tablero"

#. Translators: description of a crossword board command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Closes the board; the crossword is kept to continue it later"
msgstr "Cierra el tablero; el crucigrama se guarda para continuarlo más tarde"

#. Translators: said when asking for help in a crossword without help.
msgid "This crossword is without help."
msgstr "Este crucigrama es sin ayudas."

#. Translators: reported when trying to change a solved crossword.
msgid "The crossword is solved. To play another one, open the menu and choose New crossword."
msgstr "El crucigrama está resuelto. Para jugar otro, abre el menú y elige Nuevo crucigrama."

#. Translators: reported when there is nothing to undo.
msgid "There is nothing to undo."
msgstr "No hay nada que deshacer."

#. Translators: said after undoing, before the cell that changed.
msgid "Undone"
msgstr "Deshecho"

#. Translators: description of a lesson command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Repeats the instruction of the exercise"
msgstr "Repite lo que hay que hacer en el ejercicio"

#. Translators: description of a lesson command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid "Repeats the explanation of the lesson"
msgstr "Repite la explicación de la lección"

#. Translators: said when pressing Control+Z in a lesson.
msgid "In the lessons there is nothing to undo: a letter that does not fit is not written."
msgstr "En las lecciones no hay nada que deshacer: una letra que no va no se escribe."

#. Translators: title of a lesson, as in "Lesson 1: What is a crossword?".
msgid "Lesson {id}: {title}"
msgstr "Lección {id}: {title}"

#. Translators: accessible name of the crossword board.
msgid "Crossword board"
msgstr "Tablero del crucigrama"

#. Translators: said when a whole crossword of a lesson continues where it was left.
msgid "You continue where you left it."
msgstr "Sigues donde lo dejaste."

#. Translators: before the instruction of an exercise, as in "Exercise 2 of 3."
msgid "Exercise {number} of {total}."
msgstr "Ejercicio {number} de {total}."

#. Translators: item of the menu of a lesson.
msgid "&Next lesson"
msgstr "&Siguiente lección"

#. Translators: item of the menu of a lesson.
msgid "&List of lessons..."
msgstr "&Lista de lecciones..."

#. Translators: item of the menu of a lesson.
#. Translators: item of the menu of the crossword board.
msgid "&Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "&Atajos de teclado"

#. Translators: item of the menu of a lesson.
msgid "&Close the lesson"
msgstr "&Cerrar la lección"

#. Translators: added to the title of the board window of a crossword without help.
msgid "without help"
msgstr "sin ayudas"

#. Translators: title of the board window, as in "MiCrucigramaAccesible - Medium, Normal, 12 words".
msgid "MiCrucigramaAccesible - {description}"
msgstr "MiCrucigramaAccesible - {description}"

#. Translators: said when the whole crossword is solved; the time is only informative.
msgid "Crossword solved! Congratulations! Time: {time}."
msgstr "¡Crucigrama resuelto! ¡Enhorabuena! Tiempo: {time}."

#. Translators: item of the menu of the crossword board.
msgid "C&heck"
msgstr "Co&mprobar"

#. Translators: item of the menu of the crossword board.
msgid "&Restart"
msgstr "&Reiniciar"

#. Translators: item of the menu of the crossword board.
msgid "&Close the board"
msgstr "&Cerrar el tablero"

#. Translators: asked before restarting the crossword.
msgid "All the letters you wrote will be deleted. Restart?"
msgstr "Se borrarán todas las letras que escribiste. ¿Reiniciar?"

#. Translators: title of the confirmation to restart the crossword.
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "Reiniciar"

#. Translators: said after restarting the crossword.
msgid "Crossword restarted."
msgstr "Crucigrama reiniciado."

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid "Crucigramas accesibles en español para NVDA, para todas las edades.\nResuelve crucigramas casilla a casilla y palabra a palabra: el cursor sigue las palabras, y oyes cada pista y cómo se cruzan. Crucigramas pequeños, medianos y grandes en tres niveles de dificultad, y crucigramas infantiles pequeños de seis temas, todos generados al momento a partir de unas 3.500 palabras con pistas escritas para el juego. Juega con o sin ayudas; aprende con Aprender a jugar, un curso guiado de 14 lecciones pensado también para niñas y niños; resuelve el crucigrama del día; y consulta tus estadísticas."
msgstr "Crucigramas accesibles en español para NVDA, para todas las edades.\nResuelve crucigramas casilla a casilla y palabra a palabra: el cursor sigue las palabras, y oyes cada pista y cómo se cruzan. Crucigramas pequeños, medianos y grandes en tres niveles de dificultad, y crucigramas infantiles pequeños de seis temas, todos generados al momento a partir de unas 3.500 palabras con pistas escritas para el juego. Juega con o sin ayudas; aprende con Aprender a jugar, un curso guiado de 14 lecciones pensado también para niñas y niños; resuelve el crucigrama del día; y consulta tus estadísticas."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid "Primera versión estable. Crucigramas pequeños, medianos y grandes en tres niveles, e infantiles de seis temas, con un tablero que se recorre por caminitos y dice cómo se cruzan las palabras; con o sin ayudas; el curso Aprender a jugar, de 14 lecciones; el crucigrama del día; y tus estadísticas."
msgstr "Primera versión estable. Crucigramas pequeños, medianos y grandes en tres niveles, e infantiles de seis temas, con un tablero que se recorre por caminitos y dice cómo se cruzan las palabras; con o sin ayudas; el curso Aprender a jugar, de 14 lecciones; el crucigrama del día; y tus estadísticas."
